    title_hi: `🌐 Indian students in Kazan delighted as PM Modi arrives for BRICS Summit`,
    summary_hi: `<p>Indian students in Kazan, Russia, are happy and excited about Prime Minister Narendra Modi's arrival at Hotel Korston, as he attends the 16th BRICS... इस महत्वपूर्ण मामले पर प्रशासनिक और नीतिगत स्तर पर लगातार नजर रखी जा रही है।`,
